    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i guess, but that feels like such a cope. \"embrace the chaos\" sounds nice in a poem but it doesn't change the fact that every single struggle, every bit of effort, is just a temporary glitch in a system that's fundamentally designed to break down. it feels like trying to build a sandcastle while the tide is already hitting your feet. it's just exhausting to keep up the act of living when the outcome is already mathematically decided. it feels irrational to keep fighting it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
